":"皇太后"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m006-0118","chapter_id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:p006","quote":"太后"},{"mention_id":"c-hanshu-006-wudi:m001-0013","chapter_id":"c-hanshu-006-wudi","paragraph_id":"c-hanshu-006-wudi:p001","quote":"王美人"},{"mention_id":"c-hanshu-006-wudi:m001-0074","chapter_id":"c-hanshu-006-wudi","paragraph_id":"c-hanshu-006-wudi:p001","quote":"皇后"},{"mention_id":"c-hanshu-006-wudi:m001-0085","chapter_id":"c-hanshu-006-wudi","paragraph_id":"c-hanshu-006-wudi:p001","quote":"皇太后"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-111-wei-huo:m033-0029","chapter_id":"c-shiji-111-wei-huo","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-111-wei-huo:p033","quote":"太后"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m016-0072","chapter_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:p016","quote":"王皇太后"}],"family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi","source_id":"s-shiji-049-waiqi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:p018","quote":"王太后，槐裏人，母曰臧兒。臧兒者，故燕王臧荼孫也。臧兒嫁為槐裏王仲妻，生男曰信，與兩女。而仲死，臧兒更嫁長陵田氏，生男蚡、勝。臧兒長女嫁為金王孫婦，生一女矣，而臧兒卜筮之，曰兩女皆當貴。因欲奇兩女，乃奪金氏。金氏怒，不肯予決，乃內之太子宮。太子幸愛之，生三女一男。男方在身時，王美人夢日入其懷。以告太子，太子曰：「此貴徵也。」未生而孝文帝崩，孝景帝即位，王夫人生男。","source_term":"王仲妻，生男曰信，與兩女"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-shiji049-018","interpretation_note":"以此受傳正文的明示近親主張配置局部家族；不合併跨篇候選身份、不補闕名世代，不表示遠祖世系已核實。分支字元不是長幼排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","parent_person_id":"6d6_eg1_o3a"}},{"id":"f3j_nl2_i2g","label":"蚡（皇太后弟）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"弟蚡","mention_ids":["c-shiji-011-jingdi:m017-0114"]},{"surface":"武安侯","mention_ids":["c-shiji-012-wudi:m006-0135"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-011-jingdi:m017-0114","chapter_id":"c-shiji-011-jingdi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-011-jingdi:p017","quote":"弟蚡"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m006-0135","chapter_id":"c-shiji-012-wudi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:p006","quote":"武安侯"}]}],"source_mention_summary":[{"sourc